      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It seems I have found us a new sommelier.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Он не пьёт и не курит.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
