      "t": "'He does not drink and does not smoke.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Красивый и очень хороший семьянин.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Handsome and a very good family man.'",
      "gap": 0.45
